OL,3,GNEWSACouncils forecast #2.3m
OL,4,Ahomelessness overspend
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomelessness and temporary
OL,7,Faccommodation is expected to cost two
OL,8,Fcouncils in West Sussex more than #2m
OL,9,Fover budget between them for 2026-27.
OL,11,FBudget monitoring figures projected
OL,12,Foverspends of #1.5m at Worthing Borough
OL,13,FCouncil (WBC) and #760,000 at Adur
OL,14,FDistrict Council, with both identifying
OL,15,Fhomelessness as a major pressure on
OL,16,Ftheir finances, according to the Local
OL,17,FDemocracy Reporting Service.
OL,19,FThe figures have been highlighted in a
OL,20,Freport which is set to be discussed by
OL,21,Fthe councils' joint overview and
OL,22,Fscrutiny committee on 4 November.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
